{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "93f08d71-34e1-848e-8505-d040ee78c901",
  "created_at": "2026-01-20T15:22:42-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Omar Singh",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:20:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth, good afternoon!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:20:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, hi, good afternoon. Um, sorry to bother you. Is this the right number for the recreation classes? I want to make sure I'm calling the right place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:20:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're in the right place. What can I help you with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:20:44-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, great. So, I have been rehearsing what to say all morning, and now I think I forgot half of it. Sorry. [pause] Okay, I think there's a scholarship for the class fees? Is that a thing you handle here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:20:57-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, no need to apologize, you're doing great. Yes, we do have a scholarship option to help with class fees. It's an application, and it's through our office, so I can walk you through it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:21:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. Good. And, sorry, is it for any class, or just certain ones? I don't want to ask the wrong thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:21:17-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's meant for our recreation programs in general. If you tell me which class you're looking at, I can tell you whether it's covered or if I need to check."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:21:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the adult pottery class. Um, the evening one. Is that okay to ask about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:21:33-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely okay. Let me pull up the listing. [pause] Okay, I've got it. I'd get you the scholarship form and you'd turn it in with your registration."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:21:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And do you know when it starts? The start date? I wrote it down somewhere but I think I wrote it wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:21:50-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It looks like the next session begins the first week of February. I'd confirm the exact day on the form I send you, since I don't want you planning around the wrong night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:22:01-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's fine, that's perfect. First week of February. Okay. So the form, can you send it to me? Should I give you my number, or, um, is that not how it works?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:22:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's exactly how it works. Go ahead with a number and your name, and I'll get it out to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:22:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, it's Omar Singh. S-I-N-G-H. And the number is 401-555-0178. Did I say that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:22:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You did. Omar Singh, 401-555-0178. I'll have that form on its way today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:22:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful. Thank you so much, really. Sorry again for all the questions."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:22:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not a bit of trouble. Enjoy the pottery, Omar. Have a good afternoon!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T15:22:40-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, thanks. Bye!"
    }
  ],
